# The code shape: vim on the left, the AGENT on the right (claude by default; a
# layout can pick another with `agent <name>`), a 5-10 line full-width shell
# below for commands and log tails. A fragment -- `include shapes/code` from a
# full layout, which adds its own root/theme/agent. No window of its own beyond
# this one; included, its window/pane/bottom accumulate into the caller.
window  code
pane    vim
pane    agent
bottom  5-10
